**Canvas text methods:**
- `fillText(text, x, y)`: draws filled text
- `strokeText(text, x, y)`: draws outlined text
- `font`: CSS font string (size, family, style, weight)
- `textAlign`: `'left'`, `'center'`, `'right'`
- `textBaseline`: `'top'`, `'middle'`, `'bottom'`, `'alphabetic'`

**Canvas images:**
- `drawImage(image, x, y)`
- `drawImage(image, x, y, width, height)`
- `drawImage(image, sx, sy, sw, sh, dx, dy, dw, dh)` - cropping
- Wait for `image.onload` before drawing

